 * 4. npm < 11 with npm on PATH → `npx` (works; simpler than pnpm dlx)
 * 5. pnpm-only → `pnpm --allow-build=… dlx`
 * 6. bun-only → `bunx`
 * 7. Last resort → `npx` (warned on npm 11+ from analyze.ts)
